From de83efdafc28838a4bf98d6b98b48544680724ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MechCommander Redux Mac port <mac-port@users.noreply.invalid>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:07:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] Mac port: native arm64 build (CMake), libc++ shims,
 mission-load crash fix

- src/mac/: CMake build for bundled SDL3 + mimalloc, MCCore, MCRedux; source
  lists taken from the vcxproj files; force-included std headers MSVC pulls in
  transitively; mutex-backed std::atomic<shared_ptr/weak_ptr> (libc++ lacks
  P0718); dummy SPIR-V headers so the Vulkan presenter falls back to the
  software renderer + SDL_Renderer (Metal); MI_OVERRIDE off.
- MCServices: LocalFileTime via localtime_r on Apple (no chrono::current_zone).
- MCUpdateDisplay: skip expired screen children (crashed on mission start).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
